💭 A generic parameter of a method shadows one of its type with the same name.
🕊 🎁🐚T ⚪🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 value T
  🆕 🍼 value T 🍇🍉
  ❗️ 🔀🐚T ⚪🍆 other T ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ other
  🍉
🍉

💭 Returns a reference to the value in a boxed instance variable.
🕊 🍋 🍇
  🖍🆕 n 🔢
  🆕 🍼 n 🔢 🍇🍉
  ❗️ 📏 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ n
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🆙 🍇
    n ⬅️➕ 1
  🍉
🍉
🕊 🎀🐚T ⚪️🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 value T
  🆕 🍼 value T 🍇🍉
  🖍❗️ 🥥 ➡️ ✴️T 🍇
    ↩️ value
  🍉
  ❗️ 🥝 ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ value
  🍉
🍉

💭 Generic arguments are specialized for without boxes.
🕊 🎉🐚T ⚪️🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 list 🍨🐚T🍆
  🆕 🍇
    🆕🍨🐚T🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍list
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🐣 value T 🍇
    🍿 value 🍆 ➡️ 🖍list
  🍉
  ❗️ 📏 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ 📏list❓
  🍉
🍉

💭 A default value of an instance variable is analysed before other declarations.
🕊 🅰️ 🍇
  🖍🆕 x 🔢 ⬅️ 🔧🐚🔢🍆🕊🅰️ 5❗️
  🆕 🍇🍉
  ❗️ 🍩 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ x
  🍉
  🐇❗️ 🔧🐚T ⚪🍆 v T ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    🆕🅱️❗️ ➡️ b
    ↩️ 🍩b❗️
  🍉
🍉
🕊 🅱️ 🍇
  🖍🆕 y 🔢 ⬅️ 7
  🆕 🍇🍉
  ❗️ 🍩 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ y
  🍉
🍉

💭 The depth of specializations is bounded in closures too.
🕊 🛠 🍇
  🆕 🍇🍉
  🐇❗️ 🎎🐚T ⚪🍆 x T n 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ n 🙌 0 🍇
      ↩️ 0
    🍉
    🍇 ➡️ 🔢
      ↩️ 1 ➕ 🎎🐚🍨🐚T🍆🍆🕊🛠 🍿 x 🍆 n ➖ 1❗️
    🍉 ➡️ recurse
    ↩️ ⁉️recurse❗️
  🍉
🍉

